OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F434A1786475919
OL,3,CSwansea man sets world record as
OL,4,Clongest-serving football referee
OL,6,FWhen Ken Wright first blew his
OL,7,Fwhistle, England had yet to win the
OL,8,FWorld Cup, Neil Armstrong had yet to
OL,9,Fset foot on the moon, and Swansea was
OL,10,Fstill a town.
OL,12,FSixty-three consecutive seasons and
OL,13,Fmore than 5,000 matches later, the 78-
OL,14,Fyear-old from Swansea has earned a
OL,15,Fplace in the Guinness World Records as
OL,16,Fthe longest-serving football referee
OL,17,Fin history.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/9
