OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F434A1786475919
OL,3,CSwansea man sets world record as
OL,4,Clongest-serving football referee
OL,6,FKen's love for the game began in 1964.
OL,7,FMore than six decades on, he is still
OL,8,Ftaking charge of matches in the
OL,9,FSwansea Senior Leagues ` proof that
OL,10,Fage is no barrier to life in the
OL,11,Fmiddle.
OL,13,FKen described the achievement as
OL,14,F"unbelievable".
OL,16,FHe said: "When you think of the number
OL,17,Fof countries in the world and the
OL,18,Fnumber of referees, I just can't
OL,19,Fbelieve it's now a fact that I'm the
OL,20,Flongest serving in the world.
OL,26,@xD@JOU
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/9
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BWales News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,435,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F434A1786475919
OL,3,CSwansea man sets world record as
OL,4,Clongest-serving football referee
OL,6,F"It's something you can't believe in
OL,7,Fall honesty.
OL,9,F"To be the longest-serving referee in
OL,10,FWales would be an honour, Europe would
OL,11,Fbe an even bigger honour, but when you
OL,12,Ftalk about the whole world, it's
OL,13,Funreal really."
OL,15,FDuring the 1970s and 80s, Ken
OL,16,Fofficiated at some of English
OL,17,Ffootball's most iconic grounds, taking
OL,18,Fcharge of matches involving Arsenal at
OL,19,FHighbury, Tottenham Hotspur at White
OL,20,FHart Lane and Chelsea at Stamford
OL,21,FBridge.
OL,26,@qD@AOUuD@OO]
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/9
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
