SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F434A1786475919
OL,3,CSwansea man sets world record as
OL,4,Clongest-serving football referee
OL,6,FCloser to home, he was also appointed
OL,7,Fto Swansea City fixtures at the old
OL,8,FVetch Field, including matches against
OL,9,FEuropean giants Paris Saint-Germain
OL,10,Fand Manchester United.
OL,12,FA member of the West Wales Football
OL,13,FAssociation, Ken now spends his
OL,14,FSaturdays refereeing in the Swansea
OL,15,FSenior League.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G4/9
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
