PN,43405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F434A1786475919
OL,3,CSwansea man sets world record as
OL,4,Clongest-serving football referee
OL,6,FAcross more than six decades, he's
OL,7,Fofficiated Welsh League fixtures, West
OL,8,FWales Premier League matches and
OL,9,Funiversity games ` a remarkable career
OL,10,Fthat has taken him through almost
OL,11,Fevery level of the game.
OL,13,FBut remarkably, his first game as a
OL,14,Freferee in 1964 was almost his last.
OL,16,F"I remember my first game. It was up
OL,17,Fat Cefn Coed hospital," Ken told ITV
OL,18,FNews.
OL,26,@xD@AOUyD@WO]
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G5/9
