FL,435,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F434A1786475919
OL,3,CSwansea man sets world record as
OL,4,Clongest-serving football referee
OL,6,F"It was Glantawe vs South Gower, the
OL,7,Fscore was 13-4, and it was an
OL,8,Fabsolutely horrendous day, pouring
OL,9,Fdown with rain and I got soaked."
OL,11,FHe added: "It was a disaster from
OL,12,Fstart to finish. According to the
OL,13,Fplayers, I gave offside goals and
OL,14,Fmissed penalties, and to be fair, they
OL,15,Fwere probably justified!"
OL,17,FKen's decision not to walk away that
OL,18,Fday set him on a path that has lasted
OL,19,Fmore than six decades ` and now taken
OL,20,Fhim into the record books.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@KOUwD@YO]
