FL,435,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F434A1786475919
OL,3,CSwansea man sets world record as
OL,4,Clongest-serving football referee
OL,6,F"It's incredible, and it's a fantastic
OL,7,Fachievement for our country," Viv
OL,8,FNedin of the Swansea Referee's Society
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,F"A number of us have been referees for
OL,12,F15 or 20 years, and that seemed like a
OL,13,Flifetime to us. Over 60 years is
OL,14,Ftremendous; I think Wales should be
OL,15,Fproud of Ken Wright."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUwD@UO]
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G7/9
