FL,435,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F434A1786475919
OL,3,CSwansea man sets world record as
OL,4,Clongest-serving football referee
OL,6,FBarrie Williams, Manager of local club
OL,7,FMorriston Sports and Social, said:
OL,8,F"He's unbelievable, and you try and
OL,9,Fget some of our youngsters to be fit
OL,10,Fin my team, and they can't keep up
OL,11,Fwith Ken.
OL,13,F"He says he's going to carry on
OL,14,Frefereeing until his body tells him
OL,15,Fdifferently, so I take my hat off to
OL,16,Fhim. He's so respected around the boys
OL,17,Fin local football."
OL,26,@pD@AOUuD@AOUyD@SO]
